Subject is the publisher interface.
Product is the concrete publisher.
Observer is subscriber interface.
EmailObserver and MobileObserver are concrete subscribers.
Product keeps a collection of Observers.
When stock changes, Product calls notifyObservers().
Each observer receives the update through polymorphism (update() method).



